---
source: crates/navree-orm/tests/sql/main.rs
expression: "query(Company::query().cross_join_sub(table(\"regions\").select([\"code\"]), \"r\"))"
---
PostgreSQL: SELECT "companies"."id", "companies"."name", "companies"."country" FROM "companies" CROSS JOIN (SELECT "code" FROM "regions") AS "r"
MySQL: SELECT `companies`.`id`, `companies`.`name`, `companies`.`country` FROM `companies` CROSS JOIN (SELECT `code` FROM `regions`) AS `r`
SQLite: SELECT "companies"."id", "companies"."name", "companies"."country" FROM "companies" CROSS JOIN (SELECT "code" FROM "regions") AS "r"
